      "statement": "Error presentation in run(): errors implementing Message() string print the friendly message to stderr plus a \"Re-run with STEPDEBUG=1 for more info.\" hint (under STEPDEBUG=1 the full %+v error and message are printed); plain errors print err (or %+v with STEPDEBUG=1); all error paths return exit code 1.",
